<div class="hero-lead"><p class="hero-kicker">Personal digital security and privacy</p><h1>Your private life deserves more care than a default setting.</h1><p>You carry private conversations and years of personal history in your pocket. Who can still reach them may depend on arrangements you have barely thought about since they were set up.</p><p class="home-reassurance">Perhaps something feels wrong. Or you simply want your privacy to get the same care you give to other important parts of your life. You do not have to figure it out alone.</p><p><strong><a class="btn" href="#contact">Request a private conversation</a></strong></p><p class="trust">In person &#xB7; With you present &#xB7; One senior expert, start to finish</p></div><div class="hero-signature"><figure><img src="/assets/img/dr-tabansky-portrait-square-640.webp" width="640" height="640" alt="Portrait of Dr. Lior Tabansky" decoding="async"><figcaption data-presentation-ui>Dr. Lior Tabansky, founder of Toza</figcaption></figure></div></div></section><nav class="page-index wrap" aria-label="On this page" data-presentation-ui><a href="#the-paid-visit-inspection-diagnosis-and-urgent-first-aid">First paid visit</a><a href="#situations">Your situation</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></nav><section class="copy-section narrative-risk" id="they-may-not-need-to-hack-you" aria-labelledby="they-may-not-need-to-hack-you-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><div class="section-title"><h2 id="they-may-not-need-to-hack-you-heading">They may not need to hack you.</h2></div><div class="section-detail">
<p>Private information can be reached through many kinds of access, including ordinary features that connect devices and accounts. A service you once shared or an old device can remain part of a wider set of connections. The presence of that access does not mean someone has misused it.</p>

</div></div></section><section class="copy-section preview-full-service narrative-outcome" id="stronger-security-with-help-using-it" aria-labelledby="stronger-security-with-help-using-it-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><div class="section-title"><h2 id="stronger-security-with-help-using-it-heading">Stronger security, with help using it</h2></div><div class="section-detail">
<p>Personal Shield and Inner Circle Shield harden the agreed settings and access arrangements around your life. You learn practical security habits and how to use the changes, with personal teaching and testing of material changes. You can give your security and privacy this attention without waiting for a known incident.</p>
<p>Each full engagement has a separately agreed scope, price and purchase. Toza does not monitor your devices or install security software on them.</p>

</div></div></section><div class="narrative-expert wrap"><div class="expert-method"><p>Dr. Lior Tabansky works with you, in person, to understand what matters and carry out the agreed technical work. You can start without knowing which account, setting or past decision needs attention.</p><p>Dr. Tabansky looks at how your relevant devices, digital identities, accounts, apps and data connect. He explains what those arrangements allow in your circumstances and what a change would affect. You get help with the questions you may not have known to ask.</p></div><p>The person who learns your situation does the technical work with you. <a href="/en/why-us.html">Why I created Toza</a> &#xB7; <a href="/en/what-happens-during-the-visit.html">How Toza helps</a></p></div><div class="home-first-visit"><section class="copy-section copy-offer preview-assessment" id="the-paid-visit-inspection-diagnosis-and-urgent-first-aid" aria-labelledby="the-paid-visit-inspection-diagnosis-and-urgent-first-aid-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><div class="section-title"><h2 id="the-paid-visit-inspection-diagnosis-and-urgent-first-aid-heading">The paid visit: inspection, diagnosis and urgent first aid</h2><p><strong>Private Exposure Assessment &#xB7; Typically four hours</strong></p><p class="offer-price"><strong>&#x20AA;3,600 including VAT</strong></p></div><div class="section-detail">


<p>One main phone and one other device: a PC, iPad or second phone, with relevant identities, accounts and data access. The visit completes the agreed intake, access mapping, diagnosis and approved urgent first aid. Your summary records what was reviewed, found and changed, what remains and the next steps.</p>
<p><a href="/en/private-exposure-assessment.html">What the initial visit includes</a> &#xB7; <a href="/en/pricing.html">Full services, prices and credit conditions</a></p>
</div></div></section><section class="copy-section is-disclosure assessment-explanation" id="have-someone-work-through-the-details-with-you" aria-labelledby="have-someone-work-through-the-details-with-you-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><details class="section-disclosure"><summary><h3 id="have-someone-work-through-the-details-with-you-heading">Have someone work through the details with you</h3></summary><div class="section-detail">
<p>The paid Private Exposure Assessment includes hands-on inspection of relevant devices and access, diagnosis, and approved urgent first-aid fixes where safely possible within the agreed scope. Dr. Tabansky explains what he finds and what he proposes to change. You receive a practical summary and next steps, even if you buy nothing further.</p>
</div></details></div></section></div><div class="detail-controls wrap" data-presentation-ui><button type="button" data-expand-details aria-expanded="false">Show all details</button><span>Open any heading for more, or show everything.</span></div><section class="copy-section" id="situations" aria-labelledby="situations-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><div class="section-title"><h2 id="situations-heading">What has brought you here?</h2></div><div class="section-detail"><p>You can also come because you want stronger security and more privacy, before anything has happened.</p>
<div class="situation-pair"><article class="situation-card"><h3>Separation or divorce</h3>
<p>You may want more privacy without knowing what still connects your digital lives. Get help understanding those connections before changing shared arrangements. <a href="/en/separation-divorce.html">Separation and divorce</a></p></article>
<article class="situation-card"><h3>Business or founder dispute</h3>
<p>When business relationships change, your personal accounts can still be part of the picture. Work through what they allow and what you are authorized to change. <a href="/en/business-dispute.html">Business and founder disputes</a></p></article></div>
