</div></div></section><section class="copy-section" id="your-confidence-matters-your-approval-directs-the-work" aria-labelledby="your-confidence-matters-your-approval-directs-the-work-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><div class="section-title"><h2 id="your-confidence-matters-your-approval-directs-the-work-heading">Your confidence matters. Your approval directs the work.</h2></div><div class="section-detail">
<p>Your situation and the information you share are handled confidentially. You stay present, approve material changes and control your credentials. Toza does not keep them for ongoing use or remotely control your devices.</p>


<details class="supporting-detail"><summary><span data-presentation-ui>Service boundaries and privacy details</span></summary><div class="detail-content"><p>Work stays within your authorized environment and agreed scope. We do not promise to find or remove every exposure. We do not investigate another person, reconstruct events forensically, collect legal evidence or give legal advice.</p><p><a href="/en/faq.html">Privacy and service boundaries</a> &#xB7; <a href="/en/faq.html#how-toza-differs">How Toza differs from other help</a></p></div></details></div></div></section><section class="copy-section copy-contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><h2 id="contact-heading" class="contact-heading">You can ask for help before you have answers.</h2><div class="contact-introduction"><p>You do not need to explain everything in the first message. Send a short, neutral WhatsApp or Signal message. Dr. Tabansky replies personally as soon as possible. This conversation checks fit and urgency; it includes no device inspection, mapping, diagnosis or technical work. Contacting Toza does not commit you to purchase.</p></div><div class="contact-action-panel"><p>Do not send passwords, recovery codes, screenshots, legal documents, intimate material or details, or detailed allegations in the first message.</p>{% include "contact-channels.njk" %}<p>Suggested message: <strong>&#x201C;I&apos;d like a private conversation. Please let me know the next step.&#x201D;</strong></p><p class="contact-scheduling">If the service fits, you receive a written scope and price. The paid visit is scheduled after your explicit acceptance and receipt of payment.</p></div></div></section>